{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15082","headline":"下第献座主张谓 · 阎济美","name":"下第献座主张谓","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"謇谔王臣直，文明雅量全。\n望炉金自跃，应物镜何偏。\n南国幽沈尽，东堂礼乐宣。\n转令游艺士，更惜至公年。\n芳树欢新景，青云泣暮天。\n唯愁凤池拜，孤贱更谁怜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"阎济美","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15082.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15082","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}